Z||000004||Mattsfiero||08-14-2000||02:59 AM||||Well ladies and Gents I am glad to see I am not the only one having a little fun driving...Been in three runs in the past week actualy and one against a off duty officer still in uniform...Well I only have a 85 4cylinder but still gave him a run for his oney in a Trans-am early 90's and even a handshake.<P>Matt||||reg||1
